'''Carved''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade has a black, carved stone texture, hence the name. The edge of the blade and guard are bright orange, and the handle is solid black.
==Trivia ==

* It has a [[Carved (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

